<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<Prompt xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata">
    <masterLabel>Chatter</masterLabel>
    <promptVersions>
        <body>&lt;p&gt;In this walkthrough, you’ll learn how to share updates, find relevant activity, and manage conversations in Chatter. Select &lt;strong&gt;Next&lt;/strong&gt; to begin or &lt;strong&gt;Dismiss&lt;/strong&gt; the walkthrough at any time.&lt;/p&gt;</body>
        <customApplication>standard__LightningSales</customApplication>
        <delayDays>1</delayDays>
        <dismissButtonLabel>Dismiss</dismissButtonLabel>
        <displayType>Targeted</displayType>
        <experience>Lightning</experience>
        <isPublished>false</isPublished>
        <masterLabel>Chatter Step 1</masterLabel>
        <referenceElementContext>{&quot;scope&quot;:{&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;sfdc:TabDefinition.standard-Feed&quot;}},&quot;version&quot;:2}</referenceElementContext>
        <shouldDisplayActionButton>false</shouldDisplayActionButton>
        <shouldIgnoreGlobalDelay>false</shouldIgnoreGlobalDelay>
        <startDate>2026-09-08</startDate>
        <stepNumber>1</stepNumber>
        <targetPageKey1>home</targetPageKey1>
        <targetPageType>standard__namedPage</targetPageType>
        <themeColor>Theme2</themeColor>
        <themeSaturation>Dark</themeSaturation>
        <timesToDisplay>1</timesToDisplay>
        <title>Explore Chatter</title>
        <userAccess>Everyone</userAccess>
        <userProfileAccess>Everyone</userProfileAccess>
        <versionNumber>1</versionNumber>
    </promptVersions>
    <promptVersions>
        <body>&lt;p&gt;Select &apos;&lt;strong&gt;Share an update&apos;&lt;/strong&gt; to open the post composer. After the composer opens, select &lt;strong&gt;Next&lt;/strong&gt; to continue.&lt;/p&gt;</body>
        <customApplication>standard__LightningSales</customApplication>
        <dismissButtonLabel>Dismiss</dismissButtonLabel>
        <displayPosition>BottomCenter</displayPosition>
        <displayType>FloatingPanel</displayType>
        <experience>Lightning</experience>
        <isPublished>false</isPublished>
        <masterLabel>Chatter Step 2</masterLabel>
        <shouldDisplayActionButton>false</shouldDisplayActionButton>
        <shouldIgnoreGlobalDelay>false</shouldIgnoreGlobalDelay>
        <stepNumber>2</stepNumber>
        <targetPageKey1>chatter</targetPageKey1>
        <targetPageType>standard__namedPage</targetPageType>
        <title>Create a Chatter Post</title>
        <userAccess>Everyone</userAccess>
        <userProfileAccess>Everyone</userProfileAccess>
        <versionNumber>1</versionNumber>
    </promptVersions>
    <promptVersions>
        <body>&lt;p&gt;Enter your update. Select the image icon below the post composer to add an image or select the paperclip icon to attach a file. Use &lt;strong&gt;@&lt;/strong&gt; to mention a Sales CRM user or &lt;strong&gt;/&lt;/strong&gt; to link a record. Select the access dropdown to set the audience, then select Share.&lt;/p&gt;</body>
        <customApplication>standard__LightningSales</customApplication>
        <dismissButtonLabel>Dismiss</dismissButtonLabel>
        <displayPosition>BottomCenter</displayPosition>
        <displayType>FloatingPanel</displayType>
        <experience>Lightning</experience>
        <isPublished>false</isPublished>
        <masterLabel>Chatter Step 3</masterLabel>
        <shouldDisplayActionButton>false</shouldDisplayActionButton>
        <shouldIgnoreGlobalDelay>false</shouldIgnoreGlobalDelay>
        <stepNumber>3</stepNumber>
        <targetPageKey1>chatter</targetPageKey1>
        <targetPageType>standard__namedPage</targetPageType>
        <title>Share an Update</title>
        <userAccess>Everyone</userAccess>
        <userProfileAccess>Everyone</userProfileAccess>
        <versionNumber>1</versionNumber>
    </promptVersions>
    <promptVersions>
        <body>&lt;p&gt;Use&lt;strong&gt;@&lt;/strong&gt; when mentioning a Sales CRM user so the user receives a notification by email and in Sales CRM. Users also receive notifications about Chatter activity for records they &lt;strong&gt;follow&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</body>
        <customApplication>standard__LightningSales</customApplication>
        <dismissButtonLabel>Dismiss</dismissButtonLabel>
        <displayType>Targeted</displayType>
        <experience>Lightning</experience>
        <isPublished>false</isPublished>
        <masterLabel>Chatter Step 4</masterLabel>
        <referenceElementContext>{&quot;scope&quot;:{&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;89957d541b0841849e6a3633bcff5869&quot;}},&quot;version&quot;:2}</referenceElementContext>
        <shouldDisplayActionButton>false</shouldDisplayActionButton>
        <shouldIgnoreGlobalDelay>false</shouldIgnoreGlobalDelay>
        <stepNumber>4</stepNumber>
        <targetPageKey1>chatter</targetPageKey1>
        <targetPageType>standard__namedPage</targetPageType>
        <title>Understand Notifications</title>
        <userAccess>Everyone</userAccess>
        <userProfileAccess>Everyone</userProfileAccess>
        <versionNumber>1</versionNumber>
    </promptVersions>
    <promptVersions>
        <body>&lt;p&gt;In the left panel, select &lt;strong&gt;What I Follow&lt;/strong&gt; to view activity from people and records you follow and groups you belong to. Select &lt;strong&gt;To Me&lt;/strong&gt; to review activity directed to you, or select &lt;strong&gt;Bookmarked&lt;/strong&gt; to return to saved posts.&lt;/p&gt;</body>
        <customApplication>standard__LightningSales</customApplication>
        <dismissButtonLabel>Dismiss</dismissButtonLabel>
        <displayPosition>BottomCenter</displayPosition>
        <displayType>FloatingPanel</displayType>
        <experience>Lightning</experience>
        <isPublished>false</isPublished>
        <masterLabel>Chatter Step 5</masterLabel>
        <shouldDisplayActionButton>false</shouldDisplayActionButton>
        <shouldIgnoreGlobalDelay>false</shouldIgnoreGlobalDelay>
        <stepNumber>5</stepNumber>
        <targetPageKey1>chatter</targetPageKey1>
        <targetPageType>standard__namedPage</targetPageType>
        <title>Filter Chatter Activity</title>
        <userAccess>Everyone</userAccess>
        <userProfileAccess>Everyone</userProfileAccess>
        <versionNumber>1</versionNumber>
    </promptVersions>
    <promptVersions>
        <body>&lt;p&gt;Below the Chatter post composer, use the &lt;strong&gt;Sort by&lt;/strong&gt; dropdown on the left to sort by &lt;strong&gt;Latest Posts&lt;/strong&gt; or &lt;strong&gt;Most Recent Activity&lt;/strong&gt;. Use the &lt;strong&gt;Search this feed&lt;/strong&gt; field on the right to find information in posts and comments by keyword.&lt;/p&gt;</body>
        <customApplication>standard__LightningSales</customApplication>
        <dismissButtonLabel>Dismiss</dismissButtonLabel>
        <displayPosition>BottomCenter</displayPosition>
        <displayType>FloatingPanel</displayType>
        <experience>Lightning</experience>
        <isPublished>false</isPublished>
        <masterLabel>Chatter Step 6</masterLabel>
        <shouldDisplayActionButton>false</shouldDisplayActionButton>
        <shouldIgnoreGlobalDelay>false</shouldIgnoreGlobalDelay>
        <stepNumber>6</stepNumber>
        <targetPageKey1>chatter</targetPageKey1>
        <targetPageType>standard__namedPage</targetPageType>
        <title>Find Chatter Information</title>
        <userAccess>Everyone</userAccess>
        <userProfileAccess>Everyone</userProfileAccess>
        <versionNumber>1</versionNumber>
    </promptVersions>
    <promptVersions>
        <body>&lt;p&gt;Select &lt;strong&gt;Like&lt;/strong&gt; to acknowledge a post or &lt;strong&gt;Comment&lt;/strong&gt; to continue the conversation. You can also share a post to your profile or a group, or send a link to the post or instant messaging.&lt;/p&gt;</body>
        <customApplication>standard__LightningSales</customApplication>
        <dismissButtonLabel>Dismiss</dismissButtonLabel>
        <displayPosition>BottomCenter</displayPosition>
        <displayType>FloatingPanel</displayType>
        <experience>Lightning</experience>
        <isPublished>false</isPublished>
        <masterLabel>Chatter Step 7</masterLabel>
        <shouldDisplayActionButton>false</shouldDisplayActionButton>
        <shouldIgnoreGlobalDelay>false</shouldIgnoreGlobalDelay>
        <stepNumber>7</stepNumber>
        <targetPageKey1>chatter</targetPageKey1>
        <targetPageType>standard__namedPage</targetPageType>
        <title>Engage with a Post</title>
        <userAccess>Everyone</userAccess>
        <userProfileAccess>Everyone</userProfileAccess>
        <versionNumber>1</versionNumber>
    </promptVersions>
    <promptVersions>
        <body>&lt;p&gt;Select the &lt;strong&gt;dropdown arrow in the upper-right corner of a post &lt;/strong&gt;to open the post actions menu. Select &lt;strong&gt;Bookmark&lt;/strong&gt; to save the post for future reference. If you created the post, you can also edit or delete it.&lt;/p&gt;</body>
        <customApplication>standard__LightningSales</customApplication>
        <dismissButtonLabel>Dismiss</dismissButtonLabel>
        <displayPosition>BottomCenter</displayPosition>
        <displayType>FloatingPanel</displayType>
        <experience>Lightning</experience>
        <isPublished>false</isPublished>
        <masterLabel>Chatter Step 8</masterLabel>
        <shouldDisplayActionButton>false</shouldDisplayActionButton>
        <shouldIgnoreGlobalDelay>false</shouldIgnoreGlobalDelay>
        <stepNumber>8</stepNumber>
        <targetPageKey1>chatter</targetPageKey1>
        <targetPageType>standard__namedPage</targetPageType>
        <title>Manage Chatter Posts</title>
        <userAccess>Everyone</userAccess>
        <userProfileAccess>Everyone</userProfileAccess>
        <versionNumber>1</versionNumber>
    </promptVersions>
    <promptVersions>
        <body>&lt;p&gt;You’ve completed the walkthrough. Use Chatter to keep record-related communication organized, visible, and easy to follow.&lt;/p&gt;</body>
        <customApplication>standard__LightningSales</customApplication>
        <dismissButtonLabel>Dismiss</dismissButtonLabel>
        <displayPosition>BottomCenter</displayPosition>
        <displayType>FloatingPanel</displayType>
        <experience>Lightning</experience>
        <isPublished>false</isPublished>
        <masterLabel>Chatter Step 9</masterLabel>
        <shouldDisplayActionButton>false</shouldDisplayActionButton>
        <shouldIgnoreGlobalDelay>false</shouldIgnoreGlobalDelay>
        <stepNumber>9</stepNumber>
        <targetPageKey1>chatter</targetPageKey1>
        <targetPageType>standard__namedPage</targetPageType>
        <title>Start Using Chatter</title>
        <userAccess>Everyone</userAccess>
        <userProfileAccess>Everyone</userProfileAccess>
        <versionNumber>1</versionNumber>
    </promptVersions>
</Prompt>
